{"title": "Crawling Gnaw (Condition)", "pageid": 11872, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Crawling_Gnaw_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crawling Gnaw Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Crawling Gnaw</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Target is inflicted with zombie mucus. If the affected entity dies before the infection wears off, it will temporarily rise as a Newborn Zombie.</li>\n<li>Newborn Zombies are statistically the same as the Summoned Zombie, except that they only have 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a>, and they have the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Zombie_(Condition)\" title=\"Newborn Zombie (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Newborn Zombie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Zombie_(Condition)\" title=\"Newborn Zombie (Condition)\">Newborn Zombie</a>, causing them to take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage per turn.</li>\n<li>Newborn Zombies will follow the original Summoned Zombie. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Diseased\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Diseased_(status_group)\" title=\"Diseased (status group)\">Diseased</a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CRAWLING_GNAW_SWITCH</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCRAWLING_GNAW_SWITCH%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCRAWLING_GNAW_SWITCH%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Ico